[3.090453] getMissionInfo() :: eval: "Tristan \"Dragon\""
[3.099083] getMissionInfo() :: eval: "Welcome to the marble ropes course! Our motto is: \"Harnesses are for old people!\""
[3.190589] getMissionInfo() :: eval: "Inspired by Blasted Marble\'s \"Shocking Trial\"."
